        "cache_key": "5b8190e857e78aee4ddf6d92bc953a72",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，她拿到两个赛点，却没能拿下比赛。高芙完成逆转，她止步八强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3f0688dc7a221bd5af273cf17e3314cf24c0c2a29bc0540294b96644951cc74f",
      "words_sha256": "9adbc0c0446642d2c63bd8645b4af02a180ae3da4fa529c995a700dbba3803be"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:223122f16b02dcabb503e7c68edd667cbbb3ad832bef0c54f4b8d70d082c05a2",
      "request_id": "223122f16b02dcabb503e7c68edd667cbbb3ad832bef0c54f4b8d70d082c05a2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "650edb3e986d2174dcf111b1a00aa628",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两天后，她在北京决赛收获亚军，随后首次升到世界第三。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0049beeb2d9c3f317c08a57693585d5d48577e29738fae73ee36746d16eeeb28",
      "words_sha256": "a5a8d1551ae1acd339024d33a6af753aaace64f2c62a85d50d6a42a557afcc38"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:44d6435dfb7e81cfc73d603cf7677fb330ec05f4f47a63e96b5249d0a3f41fb8",
      "request_id": "44d6435dfb7e81cfc73d603cf7677fb330ec05f4f47a63e96b5249d0a3f41fb8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fed0665aae14806a629c6106fe1f530b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年错过单打年终，今年拿下第一座大满贯。安德烈耶娃终于拿到那张门票。但这一年，并不是一路赢过来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9d0a0801346289e4edc6c42b073d3229f237de2ddbfd8053add05b144ad76c03",
      "words_sha256": "06a9737e436fc7179b746e1e97790bccd88f550963147ccf6d3ee5c09277b634"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:457ff689c486dbf9bd17e8cdb92d30d07528335a21512d92ab15a03ea2390178",
      "request_id": "457ff689c486dbf9bd17e8cdb92d30d07528335a21512d92ab15a03ea2390178",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d99d93a30afbd02d51c7dc605856b7ca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了巴黎，她先在半决赛击败科斯秋克，再战胜赫瓦林斯卡。十九岁，首夺大满贯，她一直以来的梦想成为现实。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dc45fe51fdbd08b770c8b9358ddf783a2f1edf58290709d98d8e470e32e66d1f",
      "words_sha256": "982b90c739abe0f70952c788c66d183e9923cf12abe0d32cbb83ae38cf27ef5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5b2f942a11c25dcd44005360b1cf12523637b27e8579a75af101552edd322747",
      "request_id": "5b2f942a11c25dcd44005360b1cf12523637b27e8579a75af101552edd322747",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea105b47dc4881434600831c73f442b4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "本季至今，红土二十二胜三负，草地却只有一胜两负。温网先赢一盘，她仍被克雷吉茨科娃逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cf76f2fd9920605597afd538afef708fc769ec7bbaa20e01aedf9c384dba4ae2",
      "words_sha256": "90ea4d3fb7ff6acb59e051607588e114288918a27a16415e37fa53c8e6cf89fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:62506c105dbe6e7de2ee91dc9e3275c1d91d771101ef0f3a81ffd01163ef8c0b",
      "request_id": "62506c105dbe6e7de2ee91dc9e3275c1d91d771101ef0f3a81ffd01163ef8c0b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fe880d349630dcaded4bf7a102e1deed",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿德莱德决赛，她从零比三开始连赢九局，拿下赛季首冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "01a396383bdb269c7a479690d3d3ef9b6e9bcff47ad3511a9262fb738754c28c",
      "words_sha256": "2b71dab27d8c8333a375e2b299ec8120e92bef2474053e00b124443d486d1851"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:671b7d2df79d75f7d3f64f27b63793c85d591332e979ccb0e4420216115698a0",
      "request_id": "671b7d2df79d75f7d3f64f27b63793c85d591332e979ccb0e4420216115698a0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "621c9c72ed31f3bb5f510f41d5618735",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "澳网止步第四轮。接下来的四站硬帝，她也都没能走到四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "78d915e2bd99b9552e7d0a59a894f61a481f4397cea6bc3604c9c67b4f04d61c",
      "words_sha256": "64c4ee10f0236ec1f536ce58d1bba485bb28c8ffd0ed6c36783fe41e42327f90"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6bf714242e833939885aee685d891efff948fda26f40378c72ee029415b36483",
