        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她回顾，今年和团队更注意参赛与休息。去年错过的单打年终门票，今年终于属于她。首次单打年终，你期待她走到哪一步？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b76f2a3b9c1af38d53899aac214063f8d57712f29e1ce7a26288bad6ebb5bee7",
      "words_sha256": "8318b893b2bfa4c2d407d458243dfe16da27816fa25f010cc4d1fa6ab31b2d90"
    },
