        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月九日，官方确认她首次获得单打年终资格。去年错过的那张门票，今年不用再等到最后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "92a93c5c2cb61eb17536945fb9b9ad3fa2b4b64844a7d08f26d8a48c4645a348",
